Z||000020||paulmckibben||11-13-2001||09:49 PM||||Carl (Haze_Performance),<P>Your frustration with two sets of defective sail panels is certainly understandable.  If you sent me an e-mail about the second set I must have misplaced it and apologize for doing so.<P>According to my files I sent replacement sail panels to you about 14 months ago.  The sail panels should certainly last a lot longer than yours have (mine are about 4 years old and still look new) so let me know what you would like me to do.  I'll be happy to refund your money or provide a third set.  Please drop me a note with your choice.<P>As to the cause of your sail panel problems, I honestly don't know.  I had a bad batch of paint which was used last March through May, but your sail panels don't fall in that time frame so the problem is a mystery.  And in truth I can't swear that future sail panels won't also have problems since I have no direct control over the paint formulation and therefore only time will tell if a problem exists.<P>All my excuses aside, there is no intent to profit at your expense.  So please let me know how I can resolve this to your satisfaction.<P>I look forward to hearing from you.<P>Paul McKibben<BR>fierosails@yahoo.com||||reg||1
Z||000021||FieroHarry||11-14-2001||12:15 AM||||Good Looking out Paul!<P>------------------<BR><BR><B>"If you want to blend in, take the bus!"</B>||||reg||1
